  "summary": {
    "en": "Militant groups in Cabo Delgado have freed fishermen they had been holding captive, ending a recent hostage situation. Chapo has urged cooperation to protect Africa's strategic minerals, linking mineral security to the conflict zone. The insurgency continues as Islamist militants target civilians and clash with Mozambican security forces. A blogger was killed while livestreaming an expose of chromium pollution on a road in Mozambique. The conflict caused 151 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.",
